<tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 16px">
<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="640" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="width:100%;max-width:640px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E3E6E8;border-radius:16px">
<tr><td style="padding:32px 32px 32px 24px">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 0 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="border-left:3px solid #2E4A66;padding:0 0 0 16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Verified the Google Analytics setup in Lovable today. No code was changed and nothing was connected. Everything still open is below, most urgent first.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">Danger</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#F8E9E5" style="background-color:#F8E9E5;border-left:3px solid #9A4A3A;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="top" width="24" style="width:24px;padding:0 16px 0 0"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="24" height="24" align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#9A4A3A" style="width:24px;height:24px;background-color:#9A4A3A;border-radius:8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:24px;color:#FFFFFF;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">!</td></tr></table></td><td valign="top"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;color:#1B1F23">Google Analytics is not live anywhere on Vextron. There is no GA connection in the workspace and no measurement ID set, so no Google script loads on any page.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#FCF4F2" style="background-color:#FCF4F2;border-left:3px solid #C98476;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#C98476;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Landing pages · Wired, off</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">/contractor-program and /cool-roof-roi have the gtag code and the generate_lead event, but both stay off until the measurement ID is set. Today the event fires into nothing.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FCF4F2" style="background-color:#FCF4F2;border-left:3px solid #C98476;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#C98476;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Main site · No analytics</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">The 11 main routes have no gtag, no GTM and no analytics of any kind.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FCF4F2" style="background-color:#FCF4F2;border-left:3px solid #C98476;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#C98476;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Connectors · Not linked</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">The workspace has Google Maps, Stripe (×2), Resend and TikTok. None is linked to this project.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">Blockers</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#F8E9E5" style="background-color:#F8E9E5;border-left:3px solid #9A4A3A;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="top" width="24" style="width:24px;padding:0 16px 0 0"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="24" height="24" align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#9A4A3A" style="width:24px;height:24px;background-color:#9A4A3A;border-radius:8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:24px;color:#FFFFFF;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">×</td></tr></table></td><td valign="top"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;color:#1B1F23">5 items are needed before launch, all with Nasir.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#F8E9E5" style="background-color:#F8E9E5;border-left:3px solid #9A4A3A;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#9A4A3A;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir · Cool Roof ROI</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Replace the thermal stand-in photo. It has made-up temperatures printed on it (145°F / 78°F).</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#F8E9E5" style="background-color:#F8E9E5;border-left:3px solid #9A4A3A;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#9A4A3A;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir · Cool Roof ROI</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Real photos: the aerial of the coated warehouse roof and the two proof-card images.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#F8E9E5" style="background-color:#F8E9E5;border-left:3px solid #9A4A3A;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#9A4A3A;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir · Contractor Growth</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Next training class date and location, for [DATE · LOCATION].</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#F8E9E5" style="background-color:#F8E9E5;border-left:3px solid #9A4A3A;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#9A4A3A;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir · Contractor Growth</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Response time for the thank-you message, for [X] business days.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#F8E9E5" style="background-color:#F8E9E5;border-left:3px solid #9A4A3A;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#9A4A3A;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir · Contractor Growth</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">The contractor testimonial: name, company and city.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">Warnings</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#FCEEE3" style="background-color:#FCEEE3;border-left:3px solid #B85C1E;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="top" width="24" style="width:24px;padding:0 16px 0 0"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="24" height="24" align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#B85C1E" style="width:24px;height:24px;background-color:#B85C1E;border-radius:8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:24px;color:#FFFFFF;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">▲</td></tr></table></td><td valign="top"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;color:#1B1F23">Nasir, both pages: the shield logo is now the browser-tab icon on every page of the site. Keep it or revert it.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#FCEEE3" style="background-color:#FCEEE3;border-left:3px solid #B85C1E;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="top" width="24" style="width:24px;padding:0 16px 0 0"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="24" height="24" align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#B85C1E" style="width:24px;height:24px;background-color:#B85C1E;border-radius:8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:24px;color:#FFFFFF;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">▲</td></tr></table></td><td valign="top"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;color:#1B1F23">Shad, both pages: the mobile Lighthouse test against the 90+ target hasn&#x27;t been run yet.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">Open</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#FBF4E2" style="background-color:#FBF4E2;border-left:3px solid #8A6414;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="top" width="24" style="width:24px;padding:0 16px 0 0"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="24" height="24" align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#8A6414" style="width:24px;height:24px;background-color:#8A6414;border-radius:8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:24px;color:#FFFFFF;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">i</td></tr></table></td><td valign="top"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;color:#1B1F23">Nasir, both pages: the GA4 measurement ID (G-XXXXXXX). One ID covers both pages, and they switch on automatically once it&#x27;s added.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#FBF4E2" style="background-color:#FBF4E2;border-left:3px solid #8A6414;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="top" width="24" style="width:24px;padding:0 16px 0 0"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="24" height="24" align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#8A6414" style="width:24px;height:24px;background-color:#8A6414;border-radius:8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:24px;color:#FFFFFF;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">i</td></tr></table></td><td valign="top"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;color:#1B1F23">Nasir, Cool Roof ROI: approve the thank-you message, or send your own wording.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">Awaiting pipeline</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1.5px solid #2F6B4F;border-radius:16px;padding:16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="top" width="24" style="width:24px;padding:0 16px 0 0"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="24" height="24" align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#2F6B4F" style="width:24px;height:24px;background-color:#2F6B4F;border-radius:8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:24px;color:#FFFFFF;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">→</td></tr></table></td><td valign="top"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;color:#1B1F23">Awaiting QA and your green signal. Then a fine-tuning pass if you choose it, and both pages publish to the production URL, vextrons.com.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
